{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The key to success is Cheese</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your Move</i></strong> <strong>is a co-op survival horror game with a cheesy twist. Mr. Squeakers, a talking mouse, sends you and your friends into the scariest forest imaginable to gather as much cheese as you can for him. The game is built on ideas from the Cozy Cabin Community, whose wild suggestions helped shape it in only  60 days.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Your Friends...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen for footsteps, screams, or someone yelling \u201cI FOUND CHEESE!\u201d Moving as a group feels safer, but it also makes it far easier for something to find all of you at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044500/extras/323c2ca5cb1afca36e2a4cc72147ad63.poster.avif?t=1763744783\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044500/extras/323c2ca5cb1afca36e2a4cc72147ad63.webm?t=1763744783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Squeaker's Cheese...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather as much <strong>Cheese</strong> as you can for <i><strong>Mr. Squeakers</strong></i>, but be ready... every piece you grab  draws out things that don\u2019t appreciate uninvited collectors. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044500/extras/e1880646e0a2896af14c1419210b1c47.poster.avif?t=1763744783\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044500/extras/e1880646e0a2896af14c1419210b1c47.webm?t=1763744783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Off the Menu...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything looks out of place, it\u2019s probably best NOT to say hi. In this forest, introductions rarely end well...<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044500/extras/3faded7dcbfd17d4f82104ea89f8310a.poster.avif?t=1763744783\" width=1000 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044500/extras/3faded7dcbfd17d4f82104ea89f8310a.webm?t=1763744783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-8 unique monsters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Up to 15 Players per lobby</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Proximity Voice Chat to mess with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-CHEESE. A lot of it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-A friendly mouse named\u00a0Mr. Squeakers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-1 map that you WILL get lost in...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-An SD-40 Train.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-And More!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>All ideas suggested by the Cozy Cabin Studios community! Now it's Your Move.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044500?t=1763744783","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044500/f7d510d3fcaa3ee378c9b4cc738de4d4061563c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763744783","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044500/6d10751fd0aa6ebc713421e3d8d7df8fbb3a7ef0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763744783","